# The daily point-in-time listing panel: ~3,600 daily rankings x 2,000 ranks.
# Too large to commit and reproducible from `stat_arb/build_daily_listings.py`.
# The derived tables it feeds (bracket_*.parquet, pit_monthly_ranks.parquet)
# are committed instead.
data/pit_daily_listings.parquet

# Per-bracket return panels written by `run_bracket_panel.py`. No runner reads
# them (the bracket runners rebuild returns from the daily panel), so they are
# not committed.
data/bracket_returns_*.parquet

# Raw CoinMarketCap Pro API pull for the 2023-2025 snapshot universe. Vendor
